Iron chains can be eaten by polyselfed players whose current form is
metallivorous, or (possibly?) fed to a metallivorous pet.  Another use
has been noted (polypiling in a silly attempt at golem farming).

Cornuthaums are of use to any player who has not yet found a desirable
cloak or body armour with a cancellation level of two or three; the
cancellation bonus from a cornuthaum is not dependent on the wearer's
class.  Furthermore, a polyselfed player in a form that can digest
organic non-food can eat a cornuthaum.
